{
  "name": "dsh-profile-bridge",
  "version": "0.1.5",
  "description": "涓€閿 DeepSeek Harness 妗岄潰鐗堢敤涓婁綘宸茶濂芥彃浠剁殑 profile锛堢洰褰曢摼鎺ワ紝鑷姩澶囦唤銆侀殢鏃惰繕鍘燂級锝淢ake the DeepSeek Harness Desktop app use an existing plugin profile 鈥?one-click switch, fully reversible.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "2NF",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/2NF/dsh-profile-bridge.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/2NF/dsh-profile-bridge#readme",
  "bugs": {
